<Base title="About" description="Josef Tot: IT guy and developer in Austria, building agentic systems that automate real business work." cmd="cat about.md" jsonld={jsonld}>
  <h1>About</h1>
  <div class="prose" style="margin-top:2rem">
    <p>
      I am Josef Tot, an IT guy and developer based in Austria. This site is where I keep my notes in the open:
      how I approach problems, the tools I use, and the projects that come out of it.
    </p>
    <p>
      Most of my work right now is <strong>agentic systems</strong>: teams of AI agents that do real business work.
      That means research, marketing, product listings, regulatory paperwork, CAD plans, legal research. And
      the plumbing that keeps them honest: sourced facts, measured output, humans at the gates. My goal is to help
      other people automate their businesses the same way, on whatever platform suits them.
    </p>
    <p>
      Before that, and hopefully again, there was <a href="/music/">music</a>: producing and mixing as JOE T.
    </p>

    <h2>What you will find here</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><a href="/blog/">Blog</a> &mdash; methods and field notes, written down while they are still fresh.</li>
      <li><a href="/projects/">Projects</a> &mdash; things I built, with an honest status next to each.</li>
      <li><a href="/music/">Music</a> &mdash; productions, mixes and generative experiments.</li>
      <li><a href="/play/">A game</a> &mdash; because every proper terminal has one hidden somewhere.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>E-mail: <a href="mailto:info@joseftot.com">info@joseftot.com</a></li>
      <li>GitHub: <a href="https://github.com/F3S0J">github.com/F3S0J</a></li>
      <li>SoundCloud: <a href="https://soundcloud.com/joseftot">soundcloud.com/joseftot</a></li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</Base>
